# MadUTXO rustdesk-server Trivy ignore rules
#
# The upstream rustdesk/rustdesk-server image is consumed as-is and not
# rebuilt, so base-layer CVEs that we cannot patch without forking the image
# are accepted here. The scheduled scan (.github/workflows/scan-rustdesk.yml)
# fails on every CRITICAL finding that is neither fixed upstream nor listed
# below, so keep this list short and justified, and drop entries once a newer
# upstream image supersedes them.
#
# One Trivy ID per line, followed by a reason and a re-evaluate condition.
# There are no accepted exceptions yet.
